  "text_pages": [
    "GACHON UNIVERSITY - Airport Pick-Up\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nAirport Pick-Up\nDate and Time: 13:30,  February 23rd\nMeeting Point: Near Gate 1, 1st Floor, Incheck Airport Terminal 1\nUpon arrival at Incheon airport, connect 'Airport WIFI' and send Kakaotalk or Wechat.\nIf your flight is delayed, cancelled or you miss the scheduled flight, pelase send me Kakaotalk or Wechat and let me know expected arrival time.\nPlease let us know your flight information via the link below no later than January 15 and make a booking for airport pick-up.\nAirport Pick-up Booking Form\nIf your flight schedule has been changed, please let me know right away.\nPlease complete the survey even if you do not need airport pick-up.\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
  ],
